<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ language }}">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Robot error {{ code }}</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light dark; font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, sans-serif; }
      body { margin: 0; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f5f7fa; color: #19212b; }
      main { box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #d8dee8; border-radius: 1rem; background: white; }
      .eyebrow { color: #596579; font-size: .85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; }
      h1 { margin: .25rem 0 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .code { display: inline-block; padding: .2rem .65rem; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff0cc; color: #664600; font-weight: 700; }
      .guidance { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid #4778c7; background: #f1f6ff; }
      .note { margin-top: 1.25rem; color: #596579; font-size: .9rem; }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #10151b; color: #e8edf5; }
        main { border-color: #384352; background: #1b232e; }
        .eyebrow, .note { color: #b0bdce; }
        .guidance { background: #202e42; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">Robot error{% if class_id %} · {{ class_id }}{% endif %}</p>
      <h1>Today's floor report has a plot twist: {{ name }}.</h1>
      <p class="code">Code {{ code }}</p>
      <p>{{ description }}</p>
      <section class="guidance" aria-labelledby="guidance-title">
        <h2 id="guidance-title">What to try next</h2>
        <p>{{ recommendation }}</p>
      </section>
      <p class="note">
        {% if known %}
          The error code and description are the serious part. The suggested step is Bumper's best general advice, not model-specific magic.
        {% else %}
          Bumper has not mapped this code yet. Keep the code when reporting the issue; the robot has submitted a plot twist we have not named yet.
        {% endif %}
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
